its unit is m2
/s.
Kinematic viscosity and thermal diffusivity have the same units.
Greater the thermal diffusivity, greater is its ability to transfer heat in comparison to storage,
therefore, the larger the thermal diffusivity, the faster the propagation of heat into the medium.
