Heat exchangers
Heat exchanger is a device which is used for transferring or exchanging heat from one fluid to other
fluid.
Classification of Heat exchangers
Based on Contact â†’ 1. Direct Contact 2. Indirect contact
Based on Direction of flow â†’ 1. Parallel flow 2. Counter flow 3. Cross flow
Based on Constructional details â†’ 1. Compaq 2. Bulky
