For parallel flow over a flat plate â†’ CD = CD, Friction + Cf
Friction drag is a strong function of viscosity. Friction drag is also proportional to surface area. In
laminar flow, FD is independent of surface roughness. In turbulent flow, FD depends on surface
roughness very much.
